  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">DACs Expert Group on Aid Evaluation har beslutat g&#xf6;ra en  uppf&#xf6;ljning av DACs studie &apos;Assessment of DAC Members&apos; WID Policies and Programmes&apos;. Sida/UTV &#xe4;r ansvarig f&#xf6;r uppl&#xe4;gg av studien och sammanst&#xe4;llning av enk&#xe4;tsvar fr&#xe5;n medlemsl&#xe4;nderna.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Working Party on Aid Evaluation within DAC has decided to make a follow-up of the DAC study &apos;Assessment of DAC Members&apos; WID Policies and Programmes&apos;. Sida/UTV is lead agency for the study.</narrative>
